0 ~ AM 00:00\n❂ 裝潢\n這看起來是早年的裝潢\n天花板採用漆黑的工業風\n桌椅數還挺多的\n看似早年可能有吧檯座\n外頭還有等候區雅座\n空間上挺寬敞說ꉂꉂ(ˊᗜˋ*)ʬʬ\n❂ 服務\n小哥哥：友善、好相處\n小姐姐：聲音很是精神、鏗鏘有力\n卷卷一向喜歡溫柔\n但小姐姐的精神讓卷卷覺得多了份人情味\n有來麵可以關注這個有意思的畫面 (⁎⁍̴̛ᴗ⁍̴̛⁎)\n❂ 男湯豚骨博多拉麵 $160 加麵\n男湯：豚骨味的湯底\n❂ 女湯味噌札幌 $155 加麵 麵軟\n女湯：味噌味的湯底\n這兩碗拉麵除了\n湯底不同\n麵條軟度不同\n擺放、配菜幾近相似\n叉燒、半熟蛋、筍干、海帶、玉米、蔥花\n加麵後真的很大碗\n一個正常女生吃肯定超撐ʕʘ̅͜ʘ̅ʔ\n湯頭香氣濃郁又不會太油\n在夏天吃也是很合適的\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n✅ 現金\n✅ 自助點餐機\n✅ 兒童座椅\n✅ WIFI\n✅ 自助茶水\n✅ FOODPANDA\n\n今天很特別地想在新莊吃一個深圳也沒什麼賣的日式料理\n在台灣其實很是常見\n卷卷和水豚君就這麼晃悠晃悠的騎u bike\n一路到達美麗的河邊\n喜歡愜意悠栽吃拉麵的小浪花們可以看過來\n這裡是可以開心吃到有點台式的日式拉麵喔⑉¯ ꇴ ¯⑉",null,[0,112]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7754874966637128877/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0VVdSRWJIQlVlbFkwWVZWT1FsVnNWa1ZhTWtab1pVaHJNMVF5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7754874966637128877/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0VVdSRWJIQlVlbFkwWVZWT1FsVnNWa1ZhTWtab1pVaHJNMVF5WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7754874966637128877/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0VVdSRWJIQlVlbFkwWVZWT1FsVnNWa1ZhTWtab1pVaHJNMVF5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7754874966637128877/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0VVdSRWJIQlVlbFkwWVZWT1FsVnNWa1ZhTWtab1pVaHJNMVF5WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7754874966637128877/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0VVdSRWJIQlVlbFkwWVZWT1FsVnNWa1ZhTWtab1pVaHJNMVF5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7754874966637128877/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0VVdSRWJIQlVlbFkwWVZWT1FsVnNWa1ZhTWtab1pVaHJNMVF5WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,6680,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003